# v0.13.0: water, clouds and endless planes (milestone 13). Water is Source's Water shader on
# the top face of a brush (drawn like the mirrors: a reflection and what is under the surface,
# mixed by Fresnel, murky with depth; cheap water from the probes far away or when forced);
# endless planes are a new object (from Bryce): a flat layer at a height carrying any material
# (water, ground, clouds), lit by the sun and the sky only. Cloud planes shade the map below.
bottega make studio
rescan
# -- the starter materials of a new Bottega
expect hastexture textures/starter/water
expect hastexture textures/starter/murky_water
expect hastexture textures/starter/ground
expect hastexture textures/starter/clouds
expect matshader textures/starter/water Water
expect matshader textures/starter/clouds Clouds
expect mat textures/starter/water $reflectentities 1
# -- a pool: floor around it, walls, a pillar standing in the water
tool select
texture Tile_19
block -800 -800 -64 800 100 0
block -800 700 -64 800 800 0
block -800 100 -64 -600 700 0
block 600 100 -64 800 700 0
texture Bricks_24
block -600 100 -300 600 700 -260
block -600 100 -260 600 120 -64
block -600 680 -260 600 700 -64
block -600 120 -260 -580 680 -64
block 580 120 -260 600 680 -64
block -400 -400 0 -100 -100 200
block 200 400 -260 300 500 60
# the water brush: its top face is the water (its other faces aren't level: cheap water,
# hidden in the pool anyway; in Hammer they would be nodraw)
texture textures/starter/water
block -580 120 -260 580 680 -40
key Esc
tool light
lightset kind sun
lightset brightness 300
lightset pitch -40
lightset yaw 210
lightset pos 0 0 500
key Return
tool select
key Esc
probe 0 0 170
probe 0 400 100
tool camera
cameraset lens 28
cameraset size 480 270
cameraset pos 0 -100 250
key Return
cameraedit angles -45 90 0
tool select
key Esc
environment sky Panorama_Sky_04
renderset quality normal
render
expect render saved
expect renderlog shaders: LightmappedGeneric, Water
expect renderlog Drawing mirrors: 1 plane in view, 480 x 270
expect renderlog mirror 1 of 1: water at height -40, reflecting everything, and under the surface (murky from 0 to 1524 cm)
expect renderlog not warning
rendercopy m13-01-pool.png
closedialogs
# -- murky water: the same pool with the brown starter's settings
copy studio/textures/starter/water.vmt studio/water_clear.vmt
copy studio/textures/starter/murky_water.vmt studio/textures/starter/water.vmt
rescan
render
expect renderlog reflecting the map only, and under the surface (murky from 0 to 152.4 cm)
expect rendersame no
rendercopy m13-02-pool-murky.png
closedialogs
# -- cheap water ($forcecheap): no pictures, the probes mixed with the murk's colour
tool texture
matselect textures/starter/water
matset $forcecheap 1
tool select
key Esc
render
expect renderlog not Drawing mirrors
rendercopy m13-03-pool-cheap.png
closedialogs
undo
expect mat textures/starter/water $forcecheap none
copy studio/water_clear.vmt studio/textures/starter/water.vmt
rescan
# -- endless planes: World > Endless water / ground / cloud plane
plane water -40
expect planes 1
expect planesel 1
expect plane kind water
expect plane z -40
expect plane material textures/starter/water
plane clouds 4000
expect plane kind clouds
expect planes 2
plane ground -400
expect plane kind ground
expect planes 3
# heights in Properties (one undo step)
planeedit z -420
expect plane z -420
undo
expect plane z -400
# Delete removes the selected plane, Cmd+D duplicates (one grid step up)
key Delete
expect planes 2
undo
expect planes 3
duplicate
expect planes 4
expect plane z -384
key Delete
expect planes 3
# -- selecting: a side view's line (a click, then a drag moves it up or down) ...
planeselect none
view 2 3000 0 0.5
wpress 2 3000 -40
expect planesel 1
expect plane kind water
wdrag 3000 32
release
expect plane z 32
undo
expect plane z -40
# ... the top view shows none ...
planeselect none
view 1 3000 3000 0.5
wpress 1 3000 3000
release
expect planesel 0
# ... the surface in the 3D view (nothing in front of it)
camera 3000 3000 500 0 -60
press3d 0 0
release
expect planesel 1
expect plane kind water
planeselect none
# -- saved and opened again
save planes.map
open planes.map
expect planes 3
planeselect 1
expect plane z 4000
expect plane material textures/starter/clouds
planeselect none
# -- a render with the endless planes: the lake to the horizon, the cloud layer, cloud shadows
tool camera
cameraset lens 24
cameraset pos -1500 -1300 250
key Return
cameraedit angles -6 45 0
cameraedit active 1
tool select
key Esc
render
expect render saved
expect renderlog endless plane 1 of 3: water at height -40 (textures/starter/water), lit by the sun and the sky
expect renderlog endless plane 2 of 3: clouds at height 4000
expect renderlog endless plane 3 of 3: ground at height -400
expect renderlog shaders: Clouds, LightmappedGeneric, Water
expect renderlog water at height -40, reflecting everything
rendercopy m13-04-lake-clouds.png
shot m13-05-render-log.png
closedialogs
# cloud shadows: the same map without the cloud plane is clearly lighter
cameraselect 1
cameraedit pos -1100 -1100 700
cameraedit angles -30 45 0
render
rendercopy m13-06-cloud-shadows.png
closedialogs
planeselect 1
key Delete
expect planes 2
render
expect rendersame no
rendercopy m13-07-no-clouds.png
closedialogs
undo
expect planes 3
# -- the Camera Preview draws water and planes too
camerapreview
expect previewmirrors 1
# -- the editor: squares of the planes' pictures around the map (3D), dashed lines (side views)
planeselect 0
camera -1600 -1600 900 45 -20
shot m13-08-editor.png
quit
